{"id":"e82c18eddcbe3ca2","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form.md","title":"Nice Presentations and Normal Clauses for GLB","display":"df-glb-letterless-normal-form — Nice Presentations and Normal Clauses for GLB","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form","aliases":["89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form"],"display":"df-glb-letterless-normal-form — Nice Presentations and Normal Clauses for GLB","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas]]","[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-glb-letterless-normal-form — Nice Presentations and Normal Clauses for GLB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8de2ffea9eb2c928\" href=\"?note=8de2ffea9eb2c928\" title=\"89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas\">89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_B\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_B\\)</span>、双模态布尔宏及有限折叠取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> 为序数码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\">\\(i,j\\)</span> 为指数，分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0716e09b34db523d\" href=\"?note=0716e09b34db523d\" title=\"89-df-small-ordinal-code\">89-df-small-ordinal-code</a> 的相应有序域。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_\\alpha,c_i\">\\(h_\\alpha,c_i\\)</span> 是互异的新叶标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BC}(G)\">\\(\\mathsf{BC}(G)\\)</span> 是下式在标签集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 上自由生成的有限布尔语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}\\)</span> 在该语法域上递归。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 的定义域恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_B\">\\(\\mathcal C_B\\)</span>，各条款只在记录属于该域时使用；有限折叠使用序列位置顺序，不把有限序列当作无序集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glb\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_0(G)&amp;\\coloneqq G\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\quad\nE_{n+1}(G)\\coloneqq E_n(G)\\cup\\{\\neg e,e\\land f\\mid e,f\\in E_n(G)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{BC}(G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n(G),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LL}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\\mathrm{Var}_B(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Expr}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{BC}(\\{h_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty\\}\\cup\\{c_i\\mid i\\in J\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}&amp;:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}(h_\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq H_\\alpha,\\quad\n\\mathrm{ev}(c_i)\\coloneqq C_i,\\quad\\mathrm{ev}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}(\\neg e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{ev}(e),\\quad\n\\mathrm{ev}(e\\land g)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ev}(e)\\land\\mathrm{ev}(g),\\\\\n\\mathcal C_B&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(1,\\alpha,i)\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty,i\\in J\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty,\\alpha&gt;\\beta,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O,i\\in J\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty,\\alpha&gt;\\beta,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O,\ni\\in J,\\ j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ i&gt;j,\\ d\\alpha,d\\beta\\ge j\\},\\\\\n\\Phi(1,\\alpha,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor\\neg C_i,\\\\\n\\Phi(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor\\neg C_i,\\\\\n\\Phi(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor\\neg C_i\\lor C_j,\\\\\n\\mathsf{NF}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bigwedge\\langle\\Phi(s_k)\\mid k&lt;|s|\\rangle\\mid s\\in\\mathcal C_B^{&lt;\\omega}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glb\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_0(G)&amp;\\coloneqq G\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\quad\nE_{n+1}(G)\\coloneqq E_n(G)\\cup\\{\\neg e,e\\land f\\mid e,f\\in E_n(G)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{BC}(G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n(G),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LL}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\mid\\mathrm{Var}_B(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Expr}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{BC}(\\{h_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty\\}\\cup\\{c_i\\mid i\\in J\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}&amp;:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}(h_\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq H_\\alpha,\\quad\n\\mathrm{ev}(c_i)\\coloneqq C_i,\\quad\\mathrm{ev}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}(\\neg e)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathrm{ev}(e),\\quad\n\\mathrm{ev}(e\\land g)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ev}(e)\\land\\mathrm{ev}(g),\\\\\n\\mathcal C_B&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(1,\\alpha,i)\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty,i\\in J\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty,\\alpha&gt;\\beta,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O,i\\in J\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)\\mid\\alpha\\in\\mathcal O_\\infty,\\alpha&gt;\\beta,\\beta\\in\\mathcal O,\ni\\in J,\\ j\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ i&gt;j,\\ d\\alpha,d\\beta\\ge j\\},\\\\\n\\Phi(1,\\alpha,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor\\neg C_i,\\\\\n\\Phi(2,\\alpha,\\beta,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor\\neg C_i,\\\\\n\\Phi(3,\\alpha,\\beta,i,j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg H_\\alpha\\lor H_\\beta\\lor\\neg C_i\\lor C_j,\\\\\n\\mathsf{NF}_B&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bigwedge\\langle\\Phi(s_k)\\mid k&lt;|s|\\rangle\\mid s\\in\\mathcal C_B^{&lt;\\omega}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.215–216。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_B\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_B\\)</span> 按双模态公式树递归：字母为单点集，底为空集，两盒/否定保留内容的字母集，合取取并。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 在第二、第三类记录中统一遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\infty\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\infty\\)</span>，顺序在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 上也令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 大于所有有限指数。</p>\n<p>Nice 公式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}(\\mathsf{Expr}_B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}(\\mathsf{Expr}_B)\\)</span>；使用带标签的 presentation 可保留算法输入的索引，避免从等价的原始语法树猜取序数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 的两种生成元均翻译为有限公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>，负生成元成为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>。每个子句与整个正规形均有限；空子句序列翻译为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>此正规形是双模态无字母的特殊 CNF，不是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" href=\"?note=0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" title=\"89-df-gl-normal-form\">89-df-gl-normal-form</a> 的一般单模态析取范式，后者不是本条数学来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-ordinal-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"8de2ff